#. やぁやぁ、いらっしゃい！
#. じゃあ、最後のヒントをあげましょう！
msgctxt "0001 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Hello, welcome! Welcome, hello! Are you ready for your\n"
"final hint!?"
msgstr ""

#. オマエの足元に落ちている封筒…
#. それが最後のヒントだよん！
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Well, it just so happens to be in the envelope on the\n"
"ground in front of you!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>足元に落ちてる封筒…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The envelope...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 最後のヒントをあげましょう！
msgctxt "0004 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ready for the final hint?"
msgstr ""

#. オマエの足元に落ちている封筒…
#. それが最後のヒントだよん！
msgctxt "0005 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "It's in the envelope on the ground in front of you!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>足元に落ちてる封筒…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The envelope...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. あんな物を気にしている場合じゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I\n"
"don't have time to waste staring at it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今更、監視カメラなんかを
#. 気にしている場合じゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After all this time, I'm really not worried about this\n"
"thing anymore...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>封筒って…これの事だよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This must be the envelope...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…ちなみに内容に関しての質問は
#. 一切、受け付けませんから…
msgctxt "0010 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu... And just so you know, I won't be answering\n"
"any questions about what you find inside!"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだよ、それ…？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What...?"
msgstr "H-hở...?"

#. いいから！　いいから！
msgctxt "0012 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Don't worry, just get on with it!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマの妙な言葉に不安を覚えつつ、
#. 足元の封筒を拾い上げ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Monokuma's cryptic words didn't make me feel any\n"
"better, but I picked up the envelope...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>中を覗いてみた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...and opened it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこには、１枚の写真が入っていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What I found was...a single photograph.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>写っていたのは、見知った顔ばかり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It featured a bunch of faces I recognized extremely\n"
"well.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクと一緒に、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園にやって来たみんな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was everyone who'd come to Hope's Peak at the same\n"
"time as me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いや、でも…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait, but..."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんの後ろの…この彼女…！
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "There's someone behind Sayaka..."
msgstr ""

#. この彼女だけ…見た事が…
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "She's the only one I don't recognize...!"
msgstr ""

#. いや、違う。見た事あるはずだ！
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait, that's not true. I *do* recognize her!"
msgstr ""

#. そうだ…十神クンと一緒に、
#. 学園長室で見たファイルの中に…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's right... When Byakuya and I were in the\n"
"headmaster's room, and we looked at that file..."
msgstr ""

#. え？　戦刃むくろ…？
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Mukuro Ikusaba...?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、この彼女が…！？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then this girl is...?"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんで…？　どうして…？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...? Why...?"
msgstr ""

#. どうして、みんなが戦刃むくろと一緒に？
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why is Mukuro here with everyone else?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、それ以前に…
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And even more than that..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そもそも…こうして、
#. みんなが写ってる事自体がおかしい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just having everyone here posed like this is weird\n"
"enough by itself.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、お揃いの…見覚えのない制服で…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And we're all wearing matching uniforms. I don't\n"
"remember anything like this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、正確には、<CLT><CLT 3>“みんな”<CLT><CLT 4>じゃない。
#. だって、ここには…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>AND now that I'm looking at it...it's <CLT><CLT 3>not even\n"
"everyone<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクがいない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm...not in the picture.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクだけがいない……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm the only one not there...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>写真に写っているのは、
#. ボクを除いた１５人だけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The picture has all fifteen other students...but not\n"
"me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、ボクが写ってないのは当たり前だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I guess that makes sense.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、ボクには、
#. こんな写真を撮られた記憶なんてないし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After all, I don't remember ever taking a picture like\n"
"this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>中学が一緒だった舞園さんは別として、
#. ボクがみんなと初めて会ったのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I went to junior high with Sayaka, but the first time\n"
"I met everyone else...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この希望ヶ峰学園に来てからの事だったんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...was when I arrived here at Hope's Peak Academy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから、ボクが写ってないのは当然なんだ。
#. むしろ不自然なのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So it's natural for me not to be in this picture. But\n"
"what's definitely *unnatural*...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここに写ってる、みんなの方だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...is that everyone else *is* in the picture.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなも、ボクと同じように、
#. この学園で初めて会った同士だと思っていたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I thought everyone was like me, and didn't know each\n"
"other till they got here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、こんな写真が存在するって事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But if this picture is real...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうじゃなかった…って事なのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...then could that mean...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあ！！
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Could it be...?"
msgstr ""

#. みんなして…ボクの事を…？
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Everyone else...? And just me...?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、ボク以外のみんなは…
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Everyone here except me is...?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…いつまで自問自答してんのさ？
msgctxt "0046 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhu... How long are you gonna keep up this rambling\n"
"soliloquy of yours, Hamlet?"
msgstr ""

#. いつまでも、そんな場所に突っ立っていられると、
#. すっごくジャマなんだよね…
msgctxt "0047 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You're kinda gettin' in the way standing there, ya\n"
"know?"
msgstr ""

#. だからさ…
#. ほら、さっさと出てけよ…
msgctxt "0048 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So...I mean...get out!"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だけど…！
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "B-But—!"
msgstr "N-Nhưng...!"

#. だから、言ったでしょ！
#. 質問は受け付けないってさ！
msgctxt "0050 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I told you, I'm not fielding any questions!"
msgstr ""

#. 推理ゲームで答えを言っちゃう訳ないじゃん！
#. そんなマスコットなんて、斬新過ぎだよ！
msgctxt "0051 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"What kind of mystery would this be if I gave you all\n"
"the answers? That'd be totally out of left field!"
msgstr ""

#. どｍにおえｗ：ｍｃにあ＠ぽあいｒんｍｃぱおうＡ！？
msgctxt "0052 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "dugretTt/r@@2e!— brRRrqffqZZzzkkKk>3"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これ以上…答える気はないって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess that means he's done talking.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …クソッ！！
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Dammit...!"
msgstr "Khốn kiếp...!"

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>集合写真<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Group Photo<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>結局、ボクが体育館で手に入れたのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So in the end, all I found in the gym...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>混乱…それだけだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...was even more confusion.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それだけを手に、
#. ボクは、すごすごと体育館を後にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And with that confusion in hand, I left the gym\n"
"dejected.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>封筒は…足元に落ちてるみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's an envelope on the ground in front of me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
